</description>

<commits>
30a6c6e55a rest: include httprpc.h for StartREST, InterruptREST and StopREST

36763783e9 qt: declare ForceActivation in macdockiconhandler.h

It was declared locally in guiutil.cpp, so the definition was never
checked against the declaration.

2bfa8bfeaf rpc: declare getblockchaininfo and getdeploymentinfo in rpc/blockchain.h

1a3ecfdfb4 refactor: make functions only used in their own translation unit static

Drop their header declarations.

9cd113d615 refactor: make forward-declared translation unit local functions static

Also drop the forward declarations, reordering definitions where needed.

8d3049d679 refactor: make same-named functions in different files static

CombineSignatures, CreateTestBlock and hex_string_to_byte_vec are each
defined in two files.
</commits>

